    "body": "The UI condition of the quick pass is met on head `e76fec3fc`. The maintainer installed `xvfb` and `mesa-vulkan-drivers` on the host. The main session ran the 3 UI binaries under `xvfb-run`, as direct `cargo test` calls (not by a gate step, and not by the author):\n\n- `xvfb-run -a cargo test -j 6 -p camcraft-ui --lib`: 1667 passed, 0 failed, 8 ignored.\n- `xvfb-run -a cargo test -j 6 -p camcraft-ui --test egui_app`: 8 passed.\n- `xvfb-run -a cargo test -j 6 -p camcraft-ui --test shell`: 21 passed.\n\nThese are the binaries of the steps `ui suites: lib`, `ui suites: egui_app` and `ui suites: shell`. The coordinator accepts the direct form for this condition. The PR test runner is not necessary for these steps. The independent review of this head is still owed.",
